1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
If you connect 200,000

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,000
living human brain cells

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:03,790
to Doom,

4
00:00:03,830 --> 00:00:05,630
they can help make the character shoot.

5
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:07,600
Scientists actually did it.

6
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,580
The cells aren't inside someone's head.

7
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,120
They're growing on a chip.

8
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,260
The game sends electrical signals into them,

9
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,810
and when the neurons fire back,

10
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,435
software translates their activity

11
00:00:16,475 --> 00:00:19,250
into commands to move, turn, and shoot.

12
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,860
They're terrible at the game,

13
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,800
and a normal computer

14
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,410
still does much of the work.

15
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,830
But the weirdest part is real.

16
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,170
This video game controller

17
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,330
is alive.

